{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95b40d1914045d1225ff0d7a861477a688f3c2671a3a4144cd1966307a109d63", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nまつりの接客しているところを撮る予定だ！）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n计划拍摄茉莉接待客人的样子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "1c988070f6abf63a9424c70fcc70d9737d5d460c1aa8827efd0f72216194151c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせなのです！\nどうですか？　ウェイトレス姿、似合ってますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等了！\n怎么样？服务员的打扮，适合茉莉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4e046ba24da84ac6e00c1e432582a1fa891dcab37786b2a0ac845d57e98d59ab", "ja": "よく似合ってるよ。なんとなく、\nいつものまつりと雰囲気が違う気がするな。", "zh": "很适合你哦。总觉得，\n跟平时的茉莉气质有点不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "38f4656987348693eec2e1fe61e8a3dc18470932310dcbabcbd3355ef54914e3", "ja": "わんだほー！　姫の違いに気づくとは……\nさすが{$P$}さんなのです！", "zh": "太棒了！　竟然能注意到公主的不同……\n真不愧是{$P$}先生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "f6c6692f5727f5644997146631dfe4075f37887f0c8f902030ae004d2f44def0", "ja": "今日の姫は、ウェイトレス……。\n使っている魔法も普段と違うものなのですよ。", "zh": "今天的公主，是女服务员……\n使用的魔法也和往常不一样哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "daf2da51c1e0101975f8aed007d5c36a104ae2e18655de1ec72fa8c4a50f1a28", "ja": "はいなのです！　でも撮影を完璧にするために、\nもう少し魔法の練習をしなければならないのです……。", "zh": "是的！不过，为了让拍摄完美，还得再多练习一下魔法才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "25837f64d304c54011e4e75e51f6864fa63061c8bd2d2056452cb4f13302ab34", "ja": "だからね、{$P$}さん。……ね？", "zh": "所以呢，{$P$}先生。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1008_p", "source_sha256": "500c6e8df62e7669ed81acf04b350a7bf78d199df1002a77ef7d0762d2775077", "ja": "わかった。練習に付き合えばいいんだな。\nそれで、どんなことをするんだ？", "zh": "知道了。陪你练习就行了吧。\n那要练习什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "37c4ec0f1cec8b2f9cc1d9c84c4cb1a9fa72958344370ec89f2e317a03f0c6ed", "ja": "もちろん、お料理が美味しくなる魔法の練習なのです！\nでも、この魔法は姫だけでは使えないのです。", "zh": "当然，这是让料理变美味的魔法练习哦！  \n不过，这个魔法光靠公主一个人可用不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "ab532a7ccb67c161822e28e6dd7d25490b13e6e260a912f5b360ebe801b73db5", "ja": "必要なのは強い気持ち……！\n心を込めて、姫のあとに続いて唱えてほしいのです！", "zh": "需要的是强烈的心意……！\n希望你能饱含心意，跟着公主一起念咒语呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a2a7cc746dbc385af20f14f471fc42aa4d7e91e10b32d307e19f24664f10e4d2", "ja": "なるほどな……。\nよし！　そういうことなら任せろ！", "zh": "原来如此……\n好！既然是这样，就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "0464e424d087bb782f3f9ceb2949a8d554ad821e023cb17d52c7bca9947db4d6", "ja": "ふふっ。それでは……こほん！　「ぱぴぷぺぺこるん、\nしゃるしゃろれ！　お料理さん、おいしくな～れ♪」", "zh": "呵呵。那么……咳咳！“啪哔噗贝贝咕隆，沙噜沙洛乐！料理呀，变得好吃吧～♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1013_p", "source_sha256": "eeefe72ef5da72320643d043024a3631d68cd7812f2ffa51f56e2aea7e476c58", "ja": "……本当に言わなきゃダメか？", "zh": "……真的非说不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "7bb919869af194fb56b62bee79b416023c9e85311be5a82e976169eab16e1c36", "ja": "ふふふっ。これは、姫の練習なのです。\n大丈夫……何度も唱えれば慣れてくるのですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵呵。这是公主的练习哦。\n没关系……多念几遍就会习惯的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "c7115ff93ed119cd4f64814f4bc43bea9801d96cf7c23e6186ed26d2bc34ea8f", "ja": "さあ、{$P$}さん！\nれっつ・りぴーと！　なのです♪", "zh": "来吧，{$P$}先生！  \n一起重复吧！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0383_1016_p", "source_sha256": "352f18fb21f0ec8f76f64a39072fc527b15719938137710ec4ca329bddb1c0e6", "ja": "（猛特訓の甲斐あって、とってもいい写真が撮れた。\nしかし、魔法の練習に付き合うのも難しいな……）", "zh": "（多亏了严苛特训，拍到了非常棒的照片。不过，要陪着练习魔法也真不容易啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
